@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"saleor-dashboard": patch
+---
+
+Added age-restricted products support. Product update page has an "Age restricted" checkbox. Site settings have a minimum age and a time zone. Customer details show an age eligibility chip to staff with MANAGE_USERS, and a birthday date input to superusers only. Updated the GraphQL schema with the new age restriction fields.
