 - [Brief changes with keywords and references]
 
+### Age-restricted products: implemented, 2026-10-26
+
+- Product update page "Age restricted" checkbox; site settings minimum age + time zone; customer page birthday (superuser only, explicit "Clear birthday") and eligibility chip (`MANAGE_USERS`).
+- `schema-main.graphql` merged additively; new fields `@lockSchema(schema:"main")`; changeset `.changeset/age-restricted-products.md`.
+
 ### Rosetta workspace documentation: done, 2026-10-21
 
 - Added `docs/CONTEXT.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/ASSUMPTIONS.md`, `docs/TODO.md`, `agents/IMPLEMENTATION.md` and `agents/MEMORY.md`, alongside the Phase 3 `docs/TECHSTACK.md`, `docs/CODEMAP.md` and `docs/DEPENDENCIES.md`. The human docs were left untouched.
